{"seq":3,"slug":"code-vs-text-retrieval","title":"代码检索的特殊性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/foundations/code-vs-text-retrieval","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码检索的特殊性\">代码检索的特殊性</h1><p>把一段 Python 函数和一段产品文档放在一起，传统 RAG 会一视同仁地按字符数切块、用同一个文本嵌入模型编码。结果是：文档检索还凑合，代码检索却经常翻车。原因不在算法没调好，而在于代码和散文是两种本质不同的材料。这篇把这些差异一条条摊开——它们正是后面整章索引与检索设计的「为什么」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>散文的意义靠词的分布和上下文涌现，少一个词、换个近义词通常无伤大雅。代码的意义靠精确的结构和符号——<code>==</code> 和 <code>=</code> 差一个字符就是两回事，<code>getUserById</code> 改成 <code>getUserByID</code> 在大多数语言里就是另一个标识符。这种「精确性」与「结构性」是代码区别于文本的两块基石，几乎决定了所有下游设计。</p>\n<p>下表把四个关键差异并列出来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>散文</th>\n<th>代码</th>\n<th>对检索的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>意义载体</td>\n<td>词的分布</td>\n<td>精确符号 + 语法结构</td>\n<td>词法检索在代码上格外强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然边界</td>\n<td>段落、句子</td>\n<td>函数、类、作用域</td>\n<td>切块须对齐 AST 而非字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键信息密度</td>\n<td>较均匀</td>\n<td>集中在签名、调用、定义</td>\n<td>罕见标识符是高信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖关系</td>\n<td>弱、局部</td>\n<td>强、跨文件</td>\n<td>单块往往不自足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四条会分别在后续各篇被深挖：边界问题主讲于 <a href=\"../indexing/chunking-strategies\">分块策略</a>，符号语义的嵌入主讲于 <a href=\"../indexing/code-embeddings\">代码嵌入</a>，词法优势主讲于 <a href=\"../retrieval/lexical-hybrid\">词法与混合检索</a>。本篇负责把「为什么」讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精确符号-罕见即高信号\">精确符号：罕见即高信号</h2><p>散文里高频虚词没什么检索价值，BM25 这类词法算法早就用逆文档频率（IDF）把它们降权。代码恰恰相反——一个自定义的标识符 <code>recomputeMerkleRoot</code> 在整个库里可能只出现寥寥几处，IDF 极高，命中它几乎等于直接定位到目标。这就是为什么几十年的老算法 BM25 在代码检索上意外地能打：它天然偏爱罕见的精确匹配，而代码里最有信息量的恰恰是这些罕见标识符。</p>\n<p>可以用 BM25 的打分直观感受这一点。对查询词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 与文档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，其贡献近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>IDF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mtext>avgdl</mtext></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(q, d) = \\text{IDF}(q) \\cdot \\frac{f(q, d) \\cdot (k_1 + 1)}{f(q, d) + k_1 \\cdot (1 - b + b \\cdot \\frac{|d|}{\\text{avgdl}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8081em;vertical-align:-1.3811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avgdl</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.24em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>IDF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IDF}(q) = \\log \\frac{N - n_q + 0.5}{n_q + 0.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.528em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>：词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 出现的文档数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越小，IDF 越大。罕见标识符的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极小，得分自然被抬高。语义嵌入反而容易在这种精确符号上失手——它擅长「意思相近」，而标识符要的是「字符相同」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构边界-函数才是自然单位\">结构边界：函数才是自然单位</h2><p>散文有段落、句子这些天然的语义边界，按字符数硬切顶多切断一句话，损失有限。代码的自然边界是语法单位——函数、类、作用域。把一个函数从中间切断，前半段失去返回语句、后半段失去签名和参数，两半都不再是可理解的代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一份源文件] --&gt; B{按什么切}&#10;    B --&gt;|按字符数硬切| C[函数被拦腰斩断]&#10;    B --&gt;|按 AST 语法单元| D[块=完整函数/类]&#10;    C --&gt; E[半截代码语义破碎]&#10;    D --&gt; F[每块自足可理解]&#10;    E --&gt; G[检出无用块]&#10;    F --&gt; H[检出可用上下文]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一份源文件] --&gt; B{按什么切}\n    B --&gt;|按字符数硬切| C[函数被拦腰斩断]\n    B --&gt;|按 AST 语法单元| D[块=完整函数/类]\n    C --&gt; E[半截代码语义破碎]\n    D --&gt; F[每块自足可理解]\n    E --&gt; G[检出无用块]\n    F --&gt; H[检出可用上下文]</pre><p>正因如此，2026 年代码 RAG 的主流分块法都围绕 AST 展开（tree-sitter 解析、cAST 的 split-then-merge），让块边界对齐到完整语法单元。这条线的细节交给 <a href=\"../indexing/chunking-strategies\">分块策略</a>，这里只需记住：代码的「句子」是函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨文件依赖-单块不自足\">跨文件依赖：单块不自足</h2><p>散文的依赖是弱而局部的，一段话基本能独立读懂。代码的依赖强而跨文件：一个函数的真正含义，往往要结合它调用的工具、它实现的接口、它依赖的常量才说得清。改一个函数签名，可能牵动二十处调用点——这些调用点散落在别的文件里，却是修改正确与否的关键上下文。</p>\n<p>这带来一个深刻后果：<strong>任何「一次性捞 top-k 独立块」的检索，在代码上都有先天缺陷</strong>，因为相关上下文不在一个块里，而在块与块之间的引用关系里。这正是 agentic search 在 SWE-bench 上碾压一次性向量 RAG 的根本原因——agent 可以顺着一个符号「跳转定义、查找引用」地多轮探索，把依赖网一点点拼出来，而一次性检索只能看到孤立的块。如何在工程上兼顾「一次性粗排」与「多轮探索」，是 <a href=\"../practice/rag-over-codebase\">代码库 RAG</a> 要回答的问题。</p>\n<p>代码把依赖「写进了名字里」，这一点在检索时就成了精确的导航索：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 函数名 get_user_by_id 与它调用的 user_cache.get 都是可被精确命中的符号&#10;def get_user_by_id(uid):&#10;    cached = user_cache.get(uid)      # 顺着这个符号能查到缓存的实现&#10;    if cached is not None:&#10;        return cached&#10;    return user_repo.fetch(uid)       # 跨文件依赖：改动签名会牵动这里\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 函数名 get_user_by_id 与它调用的 user_cache.get 都是可被精确命中的符号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_user_by_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(uid):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_cache.get(uid)      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 顺着这个符号能查到缓存的实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cached</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_repo.fetch(uid)       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 跨文件依赖：改动签名会牵动这里</span></span></code></pre></div><p>名字即符号，符号即可被 grep、可被建立「定义→引用」映射，这正是词法检索在代码上格外强、以及 agent 能顺藤摸瓜的前提。</p>\n<p>把前述差异收束成对设计的直接推论：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代码特性</th>\n<th>检索设计推论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确符号</td>\n<td>词法/符号索引不可省</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AST 自然边界</td>\n<td>分块须对齐语法节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>罕见即高信号</td>\n<td>IDF 类算法天然适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨文件依赖</td>\n<td>需多轮探索而非一次性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四条推论分别落到后面四章的索引与检索设计里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代码的意义靠精确符号与语法结构，散文靠词的分布——这是所有下游差异的根源。</li>\n<li>罕见标识符是高信号，使 BM25 这类词法检索在代码上格外强（主讲见 <a href=\"../retrieval/lexical-hybrid\">词法与混合检索</a>）。</li>\n<li>代码的自然边界是函数/类而非字符，切块必须对齐 AST（主讲见 <a href=\"../indexing/chunking-strategies\">分块策略</a>）。</li>\n<li>代码依赖强且跨文件，单块往往不自足，使「一次性捞 top-k」有先天缺陷，催生 agentic 多轮探索。</li>\n<li>这些特殊性解释了为什么不能把文本 RAG 照搬到代码，是后续索引与检索设计的共同前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码检索的特殊性","id":"代码检索的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"精确符号：罕见即高信号","id":"精确符号-罕见即高信号"},{"level":2,"text":"结构边界：函数才是自然单位","id":"结构边界-函数才是自然单位"},{"level":2,"text":"跨文件依赖：单块不自足","id":"跨文件依赖-单块不自足"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"检索与上下文窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/foundations/retrieval-vs-context"},"next":{"title":"分块策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing/chunking-strategies"}}